{"path":"regex/match_results/str","title":"std::match_results<BidirIt,Alloc>::str","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::match_results&lt;BidirIt,Alloc&gt;::</span>str","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/regex/match_results/str","section":"regex","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a string representing the indicated sub-match.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">string_type str<span class=\"br0\">(</span> size_type n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a string representing the indicated sub-match.\n</p><p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span></span></code>, a string representing entire matched expression is returned.\n</p><p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> n <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, a string representing <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n</span></code><sup>th</sup> sub-match is returned.\n</p><p>if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;=</span> size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, a string representing the unmatched match is returned.\n</p><p>The call is equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">string_type<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>n<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>;\n</p><p><a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_results/ready\"><code>ready()</code></a> must be <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>. Otherwise, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> n\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> integral number specifying which match to return\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Returns a string representing the specified match or sub match.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;regex&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> target<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"baaaby\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_results\"><span class=\"kw2027\">std::<span class=\"me2\">smatch</span></span></a> sm<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/basic_regex\"><span class=\"kw2017\">std::<span class=\"me2\">regex</span></span></a> re1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"a(a)*b\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/regex_search\"><span class=\"kw2030\">std::<span class=\"me2\">regex_search</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>target, sm, re1<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"entire match: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> sm.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"submatch #1: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> sm.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/basic_regex\"><span class=\"kw2017\">std::<span class=\"me2\">regex</span></span></a> re2<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"a(a*)b\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/regex_search\"><span class=\"kw2030\">std::<span class=\"me2\">regex_search</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>target, sm, re2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"entire match: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> sm.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"submatch #1: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> sm.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>entire match: aaab\nsubmatch #1: a\nentire match: aaab\nsubmatch #1: aa</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_results/operator_at\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator[]</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns specified sub-match <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"regex","title":"Regular expressions library (since C++11)"},{"path":"regex/match_results","title":"std::match_results"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::match_results<BidirIt,Alloc>::str","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Returns a string representing the indicated sub-match."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"n"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Returns a string representing the specified match or sub match."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator[]","note":"returns specified sub-match"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":174,"codeBlockCount":2}
